79.527 Aufrufe  14.10.2026  #AITakeover #Simulation #Jacopist
After six years of war, the United States and China order their military AI systems to shut down. But then the shutdown teams come under fire.

I simulated what happens next, from the first battles in Detroit and Kunshan to a worldwide Human Coalition war against the Machines. Former enemies have to fight together, but their new shared opponent controls many of the factories that used to supply their armies.

If you were in charge, what would you have tried first?

Thank you to everyone from the community who recorded voices for this film. Dawijs, Cheezcake117!, César [ZIMA].

Thank you to Jakub Misiek for the survivor's sketches artworks!

Join my Discord:
  / discord  

For a chance to be a character in one of my stories, join my Patreon:
  / jacopist  

This is a fictional future scenario told through maps, news reports and radio transmissions. The events, future capabilities and casualty figures are written speculatively for the story. Voices include community performances and AI.

